\par\par \b \uc2 Tsy: US-China Working Group Had Substantive Talks Last Wk  \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 22:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--A six-member U.S. delegation had "substantive" talks last week in its first meeting with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and government officials in China on technical issues related to laying the groundwork for China's shift to a floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Treasury Department said Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "The team returned and had good, substantive discussions," Treasury spokesman Rob Nichols told reporters in Washington.  \par \par \uc2 The working group, which U.S. and Chinese officials agreed to form last year, met with officials in Beijing on Wednesday and Thursday. There will be future meetings, but none have yet been set, Nichols said.  \par \par \uc2 The U.S. team was led by David Loevinger, deputy assistant Treasury secretary for Africa, the Middle East and Asia, and includes officials from other government agencies.  \par \par \uc2 The Bush administration has been pressing China to adopt a flexible exchange rate. Chinese officials have said they will eventually adopt a floating exchange rate, but haven't given a timeframe for the shift.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  tightly manages its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , both through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and capital controls, effectively pegging it at 8.3 yuan to the dollar. U.S. manufacturers want China to revalue to a stronger rate, arguing the yuan is undervalued, giving Chinese producers an unfair competitive advantage.  \par \par \uc2 -By Deborah Lagomarsino, Dow Jones Newswires; 202-862-9255; deborah.lagomarsino@dowjones.com [ 01-03-04 2148GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040301e031000wi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
