\par\par \b \uc2 Daily Chinese yuan update - Feb 12.  \b0\par\par\uc2 485 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 2004\par 11:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI, Feb 12 (Reuters) - Following is a summary of market activity and news articles relating to the Chinese yuan on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS  \par \par \uc2 *** The yuan ended three notches weaker versus the U.S. dollar at 8.2774, remaining near the stronger end of its managed trading range.  \par \par \uc2 *** The one-year non-deliverable dollar forward discount versus the yuan was at 4,100 points at 1045 GMT, implying a rate of 7.868 yuan per dollar in 12 months' time.  \par \par \uc2 NDFs are transactions where a forward price is agreed between a customer and a bank, but settlement on the value date is undertaken entirely in U.S. dollars.  \par \par \uc2 *** One-year implied yuan volatility was traded at 8.75/10.75 percent on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Implied volatility is a measure of how much the options market expects the price of the underlying asset to move during the life of the option.  \par \par \uc2 The yuan moves in a band of 8.2760 to 8.2800 enforced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Turnover rose to $660 million from $600 million on Wednesday. The yuan softened to 7.8529 against 100 Japanese yen from 7.8414, and weakened against the euro to 10.6131 from 10.5049.  \par \par \uc2 OPEN MARKET ACTIVITY  \par \par \uc2 China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  enlarged the amount of short-term commercial bills issued on Tuesday as it struggles to soak up excess money supply.  \par \par \uc2 The People's Bank of China said on Monday it would issue 35 billion yuan ($4.23 billion) in three-and six-month bills - versus 20 billion yuan last week - on the Shanghai-based interbank market, where it conducts \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  with local banks.  \par \par \uc2 NEWS  \par \par \uc2 **Yuan appreciation would help ease trade row-paper  \par \par \uc2 BEIJING - Allowing the yuan to appreciate would help ease trade friction caused by its peg to the dollar, a state newspaper said on Thursday, fuelling the protracted debate over the outlook for China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Full story:  \par \par \uc2 **Emerging Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  - Buoyed by Greenspan, capped by c. banks  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE - Most Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose on Thursday after comments by the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief triggered a broad sell-off in the U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Full story:  \par \par \uc2 **Mizoguchi: Japan to act against excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO - Japan is ready to take action against excessive moves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the country's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Full story:  \par \par \uc2 **Yen, yuan would rise if no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - Greenspan  \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON - Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan said on Wednesday the value of the yuan would rise if \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  ceased \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while the yen would only rise for a while if Japan stopped \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Full story:  \par \par \uc2 **\b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs addressing over time-U.S.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO - China's rigid exchange rate policy needs to be addressed over time, U.S. Trade Representative Robert Zoellick said on Wednesday, four days after the Group of Seven rich countries criticised inflexibility in major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Full story:.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040212e02c002nt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
