\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Weaken against dlr as stocks fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 617 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juli 2003\par 11:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, July 18 (Reuters) - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were weaker\par on Friday after share markets in the region extended their\par losses and the U.S. dollar got a boost from improved economic\par data.\par     The Singapore dollar        was relatively steady after an\par early drop, but the Thai baht  extended its slide to a\par one-week low of 41.79 as the Japanese yen  weakened to\par 119 a dollar.\par  \par     "Markets are taking a breather. This does not reflect a new\par trend," said Jan Lee, strategist with Hypo-und Vereinsbank AG.\par     The South Korean won                   fell to two-week\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  lows as it reacted to the border shooting incident with North \par \par \uc2  Korea on Thursday. Seoul markets were closed for a holiday on \par \par \uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah  needed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help it off a three-week low of 8,420 after \par \par \uc2  some heavy dollar buying from offshore investors. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso  also shrugged off Thursday's \par \par \uc2  upbeat data showing a lower-than-targeted budget deficit for \par \par \uc2  the first half of 2003 and fell to three-week lows. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the moves would be short-lived and the U.S. \par \par \uc2  dollar should resume a downtrend until there were convincing \par \par \uc2  signs of an economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  "When the dollar downtrend resumes, it will be interesting \par \par \uc2  to see whether it falls against the yen or the euro, especially \par \par \uc2  because the yen has greater implications for Asia," Lee said. \par \par \uc2  The yen is expected to benefit from the reflation trade, \par \par \uc2  where investors bet on a global recovery by selling the safety \par \par \uc2  and yield of bonds to buy equities. \par \par \uc2  Japan saw record portfolio inflows of over two trillion yen \par \par \uc2  between July 7 and 11 as Japanese repatriated their heavy \par \par \uc2  investments in foreign bonds and foreigners invested in stocks. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, regional traders also focused on the growing \par \par \uc2  pressure from U.S. politicians, and even Fed Chairman Alan \par \par \uc2  Greenspan, about the need \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float the yuan and for Asia \par \par \uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  less to stop \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation. \par \par \uc2  While there were no sharp moves in regionals on Friday, \par \par \uc2  traders said speculation of a yuan revaluation would become \par \par \uc2  more of a market-moving factor in coming months. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, a group of U.S. senators said it was seeking \par \par \uc2  an investigation by the U.S. Treasury into whether China has \par \par \uc2  kept the yuan  undervalued to gain a trade advantage. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said countries which would tolerate their \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciating are likely to benefit more from the \par \par \uc2  flood of foreign capital into Asia. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     And, that meant \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  such as the rupiah and peso\par would outperform eventually, they said.\par     "The driver may be yield play, but also in terms of policy\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of allowing your \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to appreciate. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  which will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par buckle to the weak US dollar and appreciate may be primed to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par play some catch up," said Claudio Piron, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with Standard Chartered bank.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0830 GMT\par  Change on the day\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     119.03       118.22         -0.68\par  Sing dlr      1.7625       1.7589         -0.20\par  Taiwan dlr    34.468       34.420         -0.14\par  Korean won   1182.40      1178.00         -0.37\par  Baht           41.74        41.62         -0.28\par  Peso           53.72        53.59         -0.24\par  Rupiah       8318.00      8260.00         -0.70\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     119.03       118.74         -0.24\par  Sing dlr      1.7625       1.7341         -1.61\par  Taiwan dlr    34.468       34.753         +0.83\par  Korean won   1182.40      1185.80         +0.29\par  Baht           41.74        43.08         +3.22\par  Peso           53.72        53.38         -0.63\par  Rupiah       8318.00      8940.00         +7.48.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030718dz7i00hr4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
