\par\par \b \uc2  China yuan softens, ends at year-low of 8.2776. \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2003\par 11:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, June 25 (Reuters) - China's yuan  ended at its lowest closing level in a year at 8.2776 against the dollar on Wednesday, buoyed by rising dollar demand, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The close was the lowest since a finish of 8.2777 on June 26, 2002. Dealers said they saw no evidence of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the central People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has not been active in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for months. \par \par \uc2  "In a rare weakening not seen for many months, the yuan has slipped since Monday," said a domestic bank dealer. "The recent softening has been propelled by rising hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand, a sign that imports are picking up." \par \par \uc2  China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has enforced a wafer-thin range of 8.2760 to 8.2800 for the yuan, which is not fully convertible under the capital account and whose movements are mainly driven by trade flows. \par \par \uc2  The yuan moved narrowly between 8.2773 and 8.2776 on Wednesday in thin turnover of $380 million, although that was up from $330 million on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  It had moved near the firm end of the government-set range over the past two years, supported by persistent trade surpluses. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaffirmed on Monday it would keep the exchange rate stable, shrugging off calls for a revaluation from countries like the United States, Japan and South Korea. \par \par \uc2  The yuan fell to 7.0382 against 100 Japanese yen from 7.0204 on Tuesday, but firmed versus the euro to 9.5227 from 9.5567. It closed a notch stronger against the Hong Kong dollar at 1.0610. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030625dz6p00ioi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
