\par\par \b \uc2  China Yuan Ends Down On Late Session Importer Dlr Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 2003\par 10:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI -(Dow Jones)- China's yuan inched lower against the U.S. dollar Monday, as importers' demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  outstripped dollar sales late in the session, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 8.2774 yuan compared with CNY8.2772 Friday. It traded between CNY8.2772 and CNY8.2775 during the session, with most deals conducted at CNY8.2773. \par \par \uc2  "In the afternoon session, dollar demand obviously grew faster than the supply," said a trader at a foreign bank in Shanghai. \par \par \uc2  However, the trader said that strong dollar demand is expected to be short-lived and that the dollar is likely to to trade in a narrow range between CNY8.2773 and CNY8.2774 in coming sessions. \par \par \uc2  Under \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strict \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to keep the dollar/yuan rate in a narrow range. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the Hong Kong dollar inched up to CNY1.0610 from CNY1.0609 Friday, while the Japanese yen dropped to CNY6.8734 per 100 yen from CNY6.9123. The euro ended down at CNY8.8864 from CNY8.9196. \par \par \uc2  China tightly controls the flow of capital across its borders, allowing only partial convertibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the capital account. \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading on the current account is tightly monitored. \par \par \uc2  -By China Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 86-21-6218-3268; djnews.shanghai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  -Edited by Debra Boyce \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030414dz4e000js\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
