o the U.S. dollar on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020709dy79006hd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
